OL,3,AUK's third-biggest taxpayer to leave
OL,4,Afor Greece
OL,5,
OL,6,FA hedge-fund billionaire and one of the
OL,7,FUK's richest taxpayers has decided to
OL,8,Fleave the UK for Greece, the BBC
OL,9,Funderstands.
OL,11,FChris Rokos plans to open an office in
OL,12,FAthens, according to reports. Greece
OL,13,Fhas generous tax rules for wealthy
OL,14,Fforeigners earning overseas income.
OL,16,FRokos was ranked third in The Sunday
OL,17,FTimes list of Britain's top taxpayers,
OL,18,Fhaving paid #330m last year, and in
OL,19,FMarch said he would donate #190m to
OL,20,FCambridge University.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
