OL,3,AUK's third-biggest taxpayer to leave
OL,4,Afor Greece
OL,5,
OL,6,FRokos's representatives declined to
OL,7,Fcomment. A government spokesperson
OL,8,Fsaid: "The UK remains an attractive
OL,9,Fdestination for talent and investment".
